By being simplistic these selftests expect to allocate the entire set of source
/* bench 10386.3.0 dc23c5cb9f3c */
/* bench 10386.3.1 ed2d9aa22419 */
/* bench 10386.3.2 788205535e73 */
/* bench 10386.3.3 6cde81d986d4 */
